      "rationale": "Binning amount against the travel median gives a clean axis to test whether high-cost claims drive declines. Derivable from the original amount column, though the median reference is dataset-level; sample rows are non-travel yet still get a flag, which is a defensible relative comparison rather than an invented fact."
