    }
  ],
  "analytical_usefulness": 0.82,
  "source_groundedness": 0.8,
  "rationale": "The added columns provide genuine, distinct axes—travel scoping, cost tier, data-quality flag, and department/user aggregate signals—that directly support explaining and ranking drivers of travel-expense declines. None are trivially redundant or constant. Groundedness is generally sound: flags map cleanly to source fields, and the aggregate-rate columns are warranted derivations from category/department/user/state, with no invented specifics observed. Minor concern is that relative/aggregate columns are attached to non-travel rows, but this does not constitute hallucinated content."
